<title>USA: Discovery West president, COO West resigns.</title>
<headline>Discovery West president, COO West resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discovery West Corp said its president and chief operating officer, O. Michael West, has resigned, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said West, who joined Discovery in 1987, has also resigned from the company's board and those of two affiliated companies, BlackRock Ventures Inc and Inter-Rock Gold Inc.</p>
<p>David Crombie, company chairman and chief executive, will assume the duties of the president until a replacement is named, the company said.</p>
</text>
